{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本演藝圈性騷擾事件頻傳，日前TBS綜藝節目深夜播出的《全明星後夜祭》傳出爭議，該節目由有吉弘行與前「乃木坂46」成員高山一實主持，其中「真實版有吉之壁」單元，女諧星紺野Buruma（紺野ぶるま）在攀爬障礙物時，同場諧星「Marie Marie」成員Tacos竟出手揉捏對方臀部，畫面曝光後社群全炸鍋，大批觀眾痛批：「超噁心」、「怎麼會出現這種動作。」連現場主持人都看不下去。</p><p>《全明星後夜祭》日前播出特別企劃，參賽者中有各種不同身材類型，必須在限時內攀越2.7公尺高的牆壁，當紺野Buruma賣力向上爬時，站在下方的Tacos伸手觸碰她，並且手指做出揉捏的動作，女主持人高山一實尷尬脫口：「這觸碰方式不太舒服！」主持人有吉弘行也說：「她的屁股被摸得很誇張耶！」但其他參賽者不但沒有阻止，還繼續笑鬧起鬨。</p><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188809943151546368236087.jpeg/ZkMJYBr8hJRVWE-s0aI_a-UkhC2RFqoqLPxAWyz8QFs\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><p>更多紺野Buruma（紺野ぶるま）的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810198521745408528641.jpeg/68-L8O3kRebMz4OV4DVWsNV4zCmQtNoRSVUJQklVCUI\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810200933601280801439.jpeg/P7OlVl2MJLYJAJuxvUOhvMbToPbreqxWUilk6lIpZOo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203064438784178293.jpeg/ytw9FATd6HTgArZPlL27fnBXsmY6fo3yxh1o6MYdaOg\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810205161721856962385.jpeg/5yErw9-yMfOWntbZkv_hxRN-9xCtTj3Y20gM9ttIDPY\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810207305142272529308.jpeg/oP8mPweGokguX0E_a-2FDsyS3tPi2VJAjumyZ47psmc\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810199801008128136024.jpeg/HbjCcb9iyOgMDc0Q4JkCHk2eeEIJxGriSb2B2Em9gdg\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810201927651328047365.jpeg/Wk_cXGQDFnH7p9_ISyRT516grBNC6jfXv59pmr-faZo\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810203978797056129740.jpeg/K6Gft49GkI8-fXjeNIWSrBF3q9XVZKa42rApxNqwKcQ\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810206088663040652381.jpeg/wbIoSlNlVVwpsYkabqj4wctO2oRMM0AWL2Y4zC9mOMw\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810208198529024382570.jpeg/BGfAmoDU3N0lsUGDbHIJh1G8oN8DAu-e3jShsd40obE\"/><figcaption>紺野Buruma　紺野ぶるま（Instagram＠buruma_konno）</figcaption></figure><p>這個企劃因為規則設計，站在下方的人為了協助參賽者翻牆，確實可能需要協助或攙扶、並把對方往上推，但大部分參賽者在協助女性參與者時，大多會刻意避開身體敏感部位，因此當眾搓揉的動作絕對是不必要的，引起觀眾強烈反感，但當時連攝影機都特別拉近，拍攝紺野Buruma臀部遭到觸摸的畫面，棚內其他人戲謔的態度也讓網友非常憤怒。</p><figure><img alt=\"Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188808218239832064370291.png/xzkqLthDgO74SlevlrZSHQ-fWHUDAofT_SEYPf0hGD0\"/><figcaption>Tacos觸摸紺野Buruma的畫面全被攝影機拍下來。（YouTube影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>影片播出後全網撻伐不斷，曾參與該單元的男諧星黑醬事後在社群氣憤寫下：「我當時專注在挑戰，完全不知情，但這到底在幹什麼，真的太離譜了吧！」因為他與紺野Buruma私交甚篤，看到好友被性騷也十分憤怒，目前官方尚未對此事做出回應。</p><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188810890883895296291874.jpeg/mcukUBtCgwyfMwwiVCUfWWhAVloz9wJM87KiOfOyojk\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><p>點擊圖輯查看揩油者「Marie Marie」成員Tacos的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811482771492864574831.jpeg/dbXv9Alxrf0KCOwQs96O1yod7tMe3LpxQSJ2_EEidvw\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811485149794304085796.jpeg/BqrTMwvP9RxxHuGEmHTRUPKe21beBx7vdsSHbHbEh2w\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811487406460928069721.jpeg/w_Tt81JgODFQ76vjeH32od6SpVkT_BLCH9eGBh_XhgY\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811489742819328028954.jpeg/H3bZKmOZhZS-r2QJUXAwsbEmkFVMbY1yskNo9LJDaPQ\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811491970125824267549.jpeg/tz_T0vj0C608SyDSkAlb41R_HhJkF4bYnJSS75yUku8\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811482058461184163795.jpeg/p432STUejctr6e_83n_ZmYO2hEaB0uysE8osTBPKLEw\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188811484470317056301798.jpeg/modQuL2uq7uanQH661AJrjCeQwnLLNUZwpUEE8KVBBM\"/><figcaption>「Marie Marie」成員Tacos（Instagram@tacosismanzai）</figcaption></figure><p>天后梅艷芳骨灰失蹤3個月！嫌犯疑是「寺廟員工」　傳已潛逃東南亞</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:27.479929+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1568,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T11:17:41.119966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:44.933640+00:00","content_hash":"97dc71d88abc057d4edb944778fdc0373bfd37d631e40e1bbff7e4b92e6b650d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}